  "bodyHtml": "<br/>\n<blockquote class=\"callout callout_warn\" theme=\"⚠️\"><span class=\"callout-icon\">⚠️</span><h3 class=\"heading heading-3 header-scroll\"><div class=\"heading-anchor anchor waypoint\" id=\"updated-terminology\"></div><div class=\"heading-text\">Updated Terminology</div><a aria-label=\"Skip link to Updated Terminology\" class=\"heading-anchor-icon fa fa-regular fa-anchor\" href=\"#updated-terminology\"></a></h3><p>Settlements are now called Crypto Sends. These <code class=\"rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined\" data-lang=\"\">/send/crypto</code> endpoints handle cryptocurrency conversions and replace the legacy <code class=\"rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined\" data-lang=\"\">/settlements</code> endpoints. The functionality remains identical, only the terminology has changed. Legacy collections endpoints are deprecated but will continue to  work. We recommend migrating to these new <code class=\"rdmd-code lang- theme-undefined\" data-lang=\"\">/send/crypto</code> endpoints for future compatibility.</p></blockquote>\n<h2 class=\"heading heading-2 header-scroll\"><div class=\"heading-anchor anchor waypoint\" id=\"supported-stablecoin-settlement\"></div><div class=\"heading-text\">Supported Stablecoin settlement</div><a aria-label=\"Skip link to Supported Stablecoin settlement\" class=\"heading-anchor-icon fa fa-regular fa-anchor\" href=\"#supported-stablecoin-settlement\"></a></h2>\n<p>You can settle via the api in the following stablecoins.</p>\n<div class=\"rdmd-table\"><div class=\"rdmd-table-inner\"><table><thead><tr><th style=\"text-align:left\">Crypto</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">cryptoCurrency</th><th style=\"text-align:left\">cryptoNetwork</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">USDC Eth</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">USDC</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">ERC20</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">USDC Stellar</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">USDC</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">XLM</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">USDT Tron</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">USDT</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">TRC20</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"
